strawwu-install-init — Install initialization meta package (W5-N4)

Pulls in the StrawWU install-init lifecycle chain:

  strawwu-initd          shared /var/lib/strawwu/setup/state.json
  strawwu-target-setup   Calamares chroot hook (lifecycle.target_setup)
  strawwu-firstboot      GTK4 post-login wizard (lifecycle.firstboot)

Calamares finished-page zh_TW strings ship in strawwu-calamares-settings
(/usr/share/calamares/lang/calamares_zh_TW.qm). Firstboot UI uses YAML
locale files under strawwu-firstboot (not gettext .qm).
